Content:
the dragon bones(+ skull)  will drop if you right click its corpse with an empty hand :]
also, if the body still has flesh, you can get scales, its heart sometimes(i think), or an egg if its big enough. also you can use a bottle while it has flesh to get dragon blood.

int the block search, if you put in @ and then whatever the mod name is, it will show all available items.
for example, if you do Farmer's Delight, you'll get all the items attached to the cooking pot (stove, pan, cutting board, etc)
if you intend to do cooking, get to farming. there's plenty of things to grow :)
